{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011M8xDowAyXbmeDTyKpbikF","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_2/projects/recursive_gen_depth_est/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-18\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| qwen25_14b_scale_002 | Recursive generation depth signal (statistical features distinguishing d0-d3) persists at 14B parameter scale (Qwen2.5-14B FP16), achieving RF 4-class accuracy significantly above 25% baseline, validating that model collapse signatures are not artifacts of small model capacity. | — | — | — |\\\\n| qwen25_14b_scale_003 | 14B scale validation reproducibility: Qwen2.5-14B FP16 recursive chain on westd-48862 (RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell) produces consistent depth signal with gpu-6000pro-2 run, confirming results are not hardware-dependent. | — | — | — |\\\\n| olmo_seed43_001 | OLMo-1B with seed=43 and nucleus sampling (p=0.95) will reproduce the recursive generation depth signal (d0-d3 classification accuracy) observed in prior seeds, validating cross-seed reproducibility for the OLMo model family. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **pythia_seed43_001** (success): Pythia-1.4B recursive generation chain with seed=43 will produce depth-discriminative statistical features comparable to seed=42 (83.3% 4-class RF accuracy), confirming depth signal is inherent to recursive process not seed-specific.\\\\n- **gpt2xl_seed43_001** (success): GPT-2 XL recursive generation depth signal is reproducible across random seeds: seed=43 should yield 4-class RF accuracy within 5pp of seed=42 baseline (83.3%), confirming depth degradation is inherent to the recursive fine-tuning process rather than LoRA weight initialization. ← 基于 cross_model_gpt2xl_001\\\\n- **prompted_gen_gpt2xl_001** (success): Prompted generation preserves depth signal: GPT-2 XL topic-prompted 4-class acc >= 70%, delta <= 15pp vs BOS-seeded baseline (83.3%) ← 基于 cross_model_gpt2xl_001\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 64 / 负向 11 / 失败 12 / 共 109\\\\nrf_4class_acc: 0.7884 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ngpu-6000pro-2: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_004: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_base_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_base_003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_pythia_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pipeline_qwen_base_004: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_olmo_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_olmo_temp09_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_003: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- olmo_temp09_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_004: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- dcol_deberta_005: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_loo_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- depth_extension_binary_pairwise_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- depth_extension_olmo_d4d5_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- pythia7b_cross_scale_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- wild_data_redpajama_dolma_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- wild_data_calibration_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_scale_llama3_8b_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_model_recursive_chain_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- cross_scale_llama3_8b_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- qwen25_14b_scale_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan_018_binoculars_baseline: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- detector_ord_baseline_001: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- downstream_benchmark_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- qwen25-1p5b-instruct-001-phase45: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen25-1p5b-instruct-001-ph45: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen25-1p5b-instruct-001-ph45v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen25-1p5b-instruct-001-ph45v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- qwen25-1p5b-instruct-002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3389, \\\